Jikan Feature Pipeline 

A Python pipeline that fetches top anime data from the Jikan API, validates records, builds derived ML features, and exports the output as timestamped JSON files — fully containerized with Docker.

## Features
- Fetches top anime data from the Jikan REST API
- Validates API responses and individual anime records
- Builds derived features: score flags, popularity buckets, genre-based metrics
- Exports timestamped output per run — every run creates a new JSON file
- Fully containerized with Docker — no local Python setup needed

## Tech Stack
- Python 3.11
- Docker
- Requests
- JSON / Pathlib

## Output
Each run generates a timestamped file
